{
  "_comment": [
    "refresh-map.json \u2014 template \u2192 live-source map with the SHA-256 of each live source as of the last sync.",
    "Consumed by scripts/refresh-scope.sh (scan = incremental refresh scope; regen = re-baseline at release end).",
    "Template keys are relative to templates/, every key carrying its scope prefix \u2014 project/ (per-install templates) or global/ (machine-global originals). curated: true = hand-curated, no live source (the global reviewer/tracer/rr originals are curated; other globals still refresh from their live sources). Source paths are relative to the source project root: the live project `/pfm:release prepare --from` names, never this clone's same-named files; each SHA-256 is that project's file as of the last sync, and a hand-authored template edit is no sync and restamps nothing;",
    "{project:ROLE} tokens resolve via the project's .professor/manifest.json .interview.projects[ROLE]; leading ~/ resolves to $HOME (host-level sources).",
    "curated: true = hand-curated template with no live source \u2014 never auto-derived.",
    "Multi-source entries list every live file whose change forces re-derivation (representative-pattern templates).",
    "ignore_sources = live files deliberately not shipped (project-local); source_globs = the mined surfaces scanned for UNMAPPED-LIVE files."
  ],
  "source_globs": [
    "CLAUDE.md",
    ".claude/settings.json",
    ".claude/agents/*.md",
    ".claude/commands/**",
    ".claude/scripts/*.sh",
    ".claude/scripts/*.mjs",
    ".claude/workflows/*.js",
    "{project:backend}/CLAUDE.md",
    "docs/_index.md",
    "docs/standards.md",
    ".claude/skills/legal/**",
    "docs/references/*"
  ],
  "ignore_sources": [
    ".claude/commands/contentor.md",
    ".claude/commands/h/",
    ".claude/commands/deploy.md",
    ".claude/commands/test.md",
    ".claude/commands/prod-deploy.md",
    ".claude/scripts/prod-deploy-watch.sh",
    ".claude/agents/changelogger.md",
    ".claude/agents/releaser.md",
    ".claude/agents/themer.md"
  ],
